WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.552
Nka, a ma foyi fɔ.

00:00:01.632 --> 00:00:09.441
Lon dɔ wulada fɛ, a pɛrɛnna ni kanba ye ko: " Sini sɔgɔma, an bɛna domuni tɔ bɛɛ taran.

00:00:09.521 --> 00:00:14.520
" O kɔ, a tun ka kan ka fɛɛn bɛɛ dumu ka sɔrɔ k'a taran.

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:20.323
Ayiwa, o lon su fɛ, Rahabu tagara don bon dɔ kɔnɔ, ka domuni kɛ.

00:00:20.403 --> 00:00:27.215
A tun b'a fɛ ka bɔ kɛnɛ ma tuma min na, a kɔnɔbara nana kɛ kolon ye ka tɛmɛ.
